| Site search | `searchSite` → `lib/cms/search.ts` |
| Production caching | `sanityFetch` → `sanity/lib/fetch.ts` (only place for `unstable_cache`) |
| Catalog page shell | `CatalogPageLayout` + `PageHeader` (supports `above` slot) |
